        "subject": "LU-21126 tests: keep hard shutdown retry counter local",
        "message": "LU-21126 tests: keep hard shutdown retry counter local\n\nHard shutdown overwrites a caller's loop counter through Bash dynamic\nscoping, which can repeat failovers until the test times out. Declare\nthe retry counter local to protect callers regardless of their names.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Idd71fa30ca55a1ef401430cd760c139a5c311462\n"
      },
